{{!
  @template mod_moodleoverflow/mail/review_request_text

  The plain text mail to a reviewer about a post that waits for its review. Every value is printed unescaped with
  triple braces, as this is text, not HTML. Data from output\mail\review_request.

  Context variables required for this template:
  * intro - "A new post in <moodleoverflow> -> <discussion> needs your review:"
  * post - The post, see mail/post_content_text

  Example context (json):
  {
    "intro": "A new post in Lecture Q&A -> Why does my recursive function never stop? needs your review:",
    "post": {
      "url": "https://example.com/mod/moodleoverflow/discussion.php?d=2#p5",
      "by": "by Jacob Brown - Monday, 2 November 2026, 10:15 AM",
      "message": "Your function has no base case."
    }
  }
}}
{{{intro}}}

{{#post}}
{{> mod_moodleoverflow/mail/post_content_text}}
{{/post}}
